# Requires manual validation; translated with DeepL
#: ../../SO3.md:294
msgid ""
"WorldPop data for each year in the period 2020–2023, disaggregated by sex "
"(with the 2020 data duplicated for 2021,2022 and 2023 due to the lack of "
