msgid "Gridded products resulting from the analysis described in Steps 2 to 4"
msgstr "المنتجات الشبكية الناتجة عن التحليل الموضَّح في الخطوات من 2 إلى 4"

# Requires manual validation; translated with DeepL
#: ../../SO3.md:303
msgid ""
"Annual gridded products of (i) total, (ii) female and (iii) male population "
